Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定它们还没坏掉   你确定它们没有坏透嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sure they haven't gone bad? You sure they're not very, very bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.89,0:06:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  真的  它们还好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, really. They're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会把它们切得很漂亮吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gonna slice them up real nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我想把它们切成条\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. Actually, I was gonna do them julienne.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.27,0:06:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我要辞职  我刚帮了一个81岁的老太太系上皮带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, I'm quitting. I just helped an 81-year-old woman put on a thong...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而她竟然根本没买\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and she didn't even buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要辞职   就这样   我现在就要跟老板说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm telling you I'm quitting. That's it. I'm talking to my boss right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我马上就去  马上就去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, I am. Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  听到留言请回电\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, bye. Call me when you get this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.79,0:07:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他来按摩  本来挺好的  可是后来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, he came in for a massage, and everything was fine until...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.72,0:07:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后突然间  他动手动脚也不算啥了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And all of a sudden, his hands weren't the problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他有没有   他那儿用来搭帐棚都绰绰有余了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was it? Oh, Boy Scouts could've camped under there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吃了我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You ate my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纯粹是个失误   谁都可能会犯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was a simple mistake. It could happen to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别激动\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.45,0:07:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到我办公室来找   垃圾桶里可能还有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come look in my office. Some of it may still be in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  它太大了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Well, it was quite large.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分都被我扔了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to throw most of it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你扔掉了我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You threw my sandwich away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想拿到这个角色   你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just, I want this part so much, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我没拿到  我就再也不吃起司通心面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I don't get this part, I'm never gonna eat macaroni and cheese again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没那样说  那不算的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I didn't say that. That doesn't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  各位  我又不是搬到欧洲去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, guys. It's not like I moved to Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.69,0:08:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是搬到对面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just moved across the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如摩妮卡不会过敏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we would have you over all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们随时能过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if it weren't for Monica's allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错   我骗不了你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right, I could never lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.33,0:08:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她讨厌你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.21,0:08:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该接吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Should I get that? Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  不  乔伊现在不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Uh, no, Joey's not here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要留言吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I take a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  试镜从5点改到2点半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay. So the audition's been moved from 5 to 2:30?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, great. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没穿衣服   我又光着身子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aren't you dressed yet? Am I naked again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们15分钟后要去见我爸妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're supposed to meet my parents in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我只是在跟他们聊天  你看他们嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I was just talking to the guys. Just look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是   他们可以去找我们吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, is it okay if they come visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我的过敏怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about my allergies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊   你会过敏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Your allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是她   她讨厌你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All her. She hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.11,0:09:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是这些小人能变成真人大小  那该有多酷啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How cool would it be if you could watch like a real life-size version of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.28,0:09:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说该有多过瘾啊   跟足球一样过瘾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, how crazy would that be? As crazy as soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么  不是5点才试镜嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about? The audition's not till 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人告诉我啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, nobody told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟谁说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who'd you talk to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你没有看到我的留言吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean you didn't get it from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个患有敏感症的家伙入选了   谢谢你啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The allergy guy got the part. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们能补救   你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe we can fix it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们能送巨无霸大花去吓吓他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we can send him some big, big flowers and scare him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能这样对我   钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could you do this to me Chandler?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个角色能扭转我的整个演艺生涯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This part could've turned my whole career around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.28,0:10:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的错  对不起  我真的搞砸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I messed up, okay? I'm sorry. I really messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都已经不住在这里了  干嘛要接听我的电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't even live here anymore. Why'd you answer my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以录音的  是我买给你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have a machine! Which I bought for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还教你怎么用   你还以为它是复印机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Taught you how to use it. You thought it was a copier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意尽全力挽救这个错误   我一定会做  知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If there was anything I could do, I would do it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是人起码可以犯一次错错  不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But everybody's allowed one mistake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可以送我录影机  或是一对高尔夫球杆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He could have gotten me a VCR. He could have gotten me golf clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.35,0:10:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是  他偏偏要送我这个  吓跑女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But no, he has to get me the woman repeller.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:11:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着碍眼  戴着碍事儿的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The eyesore from the Liberace House of Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没那么严重啦  你当然说得容易了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's not that bad. Oh, yeah, easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又不必戴着  被某个老粗淘汰的金饰到处跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't have to walk around sporting some reject from the Mr. T Collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler. Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.03,0:11:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真同情戴这个手饰的人  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I pity the fool who puts on my jewelry! I do! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.78,0:11:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真同情戴这个  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I pity the fool that--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚迟到后   凯西和我聊了起来  然后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you were late last night, Kathy and I got to talking and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情演变到后来就\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...one thing led to another and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就什么  你跟她上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what? Did you sleep with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.25,0:11:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我只是吻了她  什么  那更糟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No, I just kissed her. What? That's even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.01,0:11:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会更糟   我不知道  反正都一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How is that worse? I don't know! But it's the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  我无话可说  我太过分了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right, I have no excuses. I was totally over the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"过分"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Over the line?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就过分到  连过分见到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're so far past the line that you can't even see the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.31,0:11:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都会说你过分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, the line is a dot to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不奢望你马上原谅我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I'm not saying that you should magically forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你也不完美   你也做过错误的判断\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you're not perfect. You've made some errors in judgment too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,举个例子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Name one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.57,0:11:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:12:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他答应不拿沙发椅的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, man! He promised he wouldn't take the chairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.91,0:12:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事   你怎么会被关进去呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell happened? How were you locked in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的东西呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And where the hell's all of our stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一个人过来看柜子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this guy came by to look at the unit...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说他不相信能塞下一个大人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he said he didn't think big enough to fit a grown man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你就自愿进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you got in voluntarily?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想把柜子卖出去嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was trying to make a sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.51,0:12:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是让我碰上他  你猜我会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man, if I ever run into that guy again, you know what I'm gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.06,0:12:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把屁股翘起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bend over?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住  不准交换  美女是你的  失恋女是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now remember, no trading. You get the pretty one, I get the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.57,0:12:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  乔伊  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Joey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就是你带来的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, well. Look what you brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又带谁来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what did you bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在寄放外套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's checking her coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   我要去洗个手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, I'm gonna go wash the cab smell off my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你帮我叫一杯白酒   帮珍妮丝叫一杯红酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Will you get me a white Zinfandel and a glass of red for Janice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Janice?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Janice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊的栽缝吃我豆腐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey's tailor took advantage of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能   我找他做了12年衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way. I've been going to the guy for 12 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.65,0:13:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托啦   他说要量裤管内侧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He said he was gonna do my inseam...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他的手一路摸上来   然后就\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then he ran his hand up my leg and then there was definite...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.54,0:13:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包住了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cupping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,裤子就是那样量的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's how they do pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.63,0:13:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你告诉他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, will you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,裤子不都是那样量的  是啊  是啊  在监狱里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't that how a tailor measures pants? Yes, yes, it is. In prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫你举一个就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I said name one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我居然这么粗心  我真白痴  别再自责了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I did this. What an idiot. Stop beating yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人都会犯错   这是难免的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People make mistakes. These things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.45,0:14:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有忘记帮我记留言吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There aren't any messages you've forgotten to give me, are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然  你不太会记留言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Apparently, you're not very good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得他会原谅我吗  当然会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you think he'll ever forgive me? Of course he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  但最重要的是  你得原谅自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, the most important thing is that you forgive yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我已经原谅自己了  这么快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what, I kind of have. Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你犯的错蛮严重的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was pretty bad, what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  他会原谅你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? He will forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我接电话时都会带便条纸  以防万一  好啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I like to bring a pad with me when I go answer the phone, just in case. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没看到他气成什么样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You didn't see how mad he was, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会原谅你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sure he will forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都有这种经验  吵架  和解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, we've all been there, you know? You fight, you make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the way it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感情破裂  往往是两个人的错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It took two people to break up this relationship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.28,0:14:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你和复印店那个女的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! You and that girl from the copy place...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨天表明愿意负责\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...which yesterday you took full responsibility for!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我负的是什么责\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't know what I was taking responsibility for, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.62,0:14:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没把信看完\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't finish the whole letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.58,0:14:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   我睡着了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.45,0:14:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你睡着了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You fell asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.17,0:14:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时是早上5点半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was 5:30 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:15:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一废话就废话了十八页\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you had rambled on for 18 pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正反面都写满了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Front and back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.60,0:15:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有 "你得"是指 "你必须"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And by the way? Y-O-U, apostrophe R-E means, "you are."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"你的"是所有格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y-O-U-R means "your."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.39,0:15:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我居然想要跟你复合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know I can't believe I thought of getting back together with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.52,0:15:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本就完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are so over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便告诉你   那种事并不常见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And hey! just so you know, it's not that common...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是男人都会那样   没有什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it doesn't happen to every guy, and it is a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有权利和他约会   这真是太荒谬了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You had no right to go out with him. That is the most ridiculous--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你出卖了我   我没有出卖你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sold me out! I did not sell you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你出卖了  你当然出卖了我   你还让我说话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, you did! You absolutely sold me-Would you let me talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弹了我的额头吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you just flick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:51.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不让我说完   我只是想  我很\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, you wouldn't let me finish and I was just-Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop it! Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手  住手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}stop. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  不要这样  不要啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. No, let's not do this. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想想快乐的事   不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy thoughts. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别打了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop it! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了   我就要踢屁股了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now I'm gonna kick some ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,痛  痛  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ow. Ow. Ow. I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你们住手  我就放手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Now, I will let go if you both stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样多好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗   如果在监狱  你们就是我的喽罗了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha. You know what? If we were in prison, you guys would be like my bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗   兄弟   你瞧瞧怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, buddy boy, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你敢藏我的衣服    我就把你衣服都穿上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You hide my clothes? I'm wearing everything you own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊  我是钱德   我还能再多穿点衣服吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at me, I'm Chandler! Could I be wearing any more clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我要去玩野战游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe if I wasn't going "commando."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.55,0:17:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿这么多衣服真热   我最好别蹲什么弓箭步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Whew, it's hot with all of this stuff on. I better not do any, I don't know, lunges. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.34,0:17:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think of all the friends I know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I dial the telephone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}no one's home
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How by myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't wanna leave how by myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and how by myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你买了乔伊套餮   两个披萨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Got you the Joey special. Two pizzas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  又来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊现在不在   我可以帮你留言吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Joey's not here right now, but I can take a message. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还有机会得到那个角色   真是个好消息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's still got a chance for the part? Oh, That's great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显不是因为  那位被狗咬伤的演员而幸灾乐祸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, no, obviously not for the actor who was mauled by his dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.09,0:18:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  我会转告乔伊   谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh well, that's great. I will give Joey the message. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.27,0:18:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mac...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...audition...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2点钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...at 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过敏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Allergy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...actor...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.40,0:18:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遭攻击\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被花\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请告诉我   你有收到留言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Please tell me you got the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.55,0:19:15.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么留言  要演麦克的演员不能演了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What message? The actor playing Mac couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要你2点过去   什么   明明是6点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They needed to see you at 2:00. What? It's 6:00!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.47,0:19:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看  我写了  我写在留言板上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look! I wrote it! I wrote it on the board!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我写在留言板上  然后跑遍整个纽约去找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wrote it on the board, then went looking all New York City looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跑去罗斯家  跑去咖啡厅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I went to Ross's, I went to the coffee house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑去每一个有三明治的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I went to any place that they make sandwiches!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信   钱德   对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe this, Chandler! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就说恭喜吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well you-you-you-you might say congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到留官板   跑去试镜   我拿到那角色了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I saw the board, I went to the audition, I got the part!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.71,0:19:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得很好笑吗   我刚才真的很担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that supposed to be funny? I was really worried over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.50,0:19:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉   有时候这样骗人真的很恶劣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well I'm  sorry. Y'know, sometimes that fake out thing is just mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  伙计  抱歉  我不是故意让你难受的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, man. I'm sorry. I did not mean to make you feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.18,0:19:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎  没什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你不是有意的   我好替你高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you didn't. And I'm incredibly happy for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:20:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好恶劣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你告诉我去的   我们这样玩一整天都玩不完的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You had me going there! We could do this all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.15,0:20:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们来聊聊我会有多红\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay look, listen, let's talk about what a huge star I'm gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会变成超级大明星  我要抱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are gonna be a huge star. I'm gonna hug you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来抱吧  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You hug me. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You really gotta a hold on me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You really gotta a hold on me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You really gotta a hold on me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Baby! I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.33,0:20:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All I want you to do is just hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please  squeeze me  hold me  hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会不会抱的太久了  我也觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, do we do this too much? I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我   就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Get off me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.41,0:20:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"吉事  我不会扔下你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Come on, C.H.E.E.S.E., I'm not leaving without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从中央处理器   启动备用电源"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Try routing your backup power source through your primary CPU."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.45,0:21:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"没办法  我的电路烧焦了 它们烧焦了  我告诉你"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"I can't! My circuits are fried! They're fried, I tell you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"那我就背你"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Well, then I'll just have to carry you."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"好棒的招数啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"That'll be a neat trick...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你死了再说"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...when you're dead!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.43,0:21:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你不必用喊的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you don't have to yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才有爆炸   我的听力可能会受损\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There was just an explosion, okay? My hearing would be impaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you were excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.15,0:21:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实有几分钟我一直在想   我甚至觉得"罗斯怎么还不出场"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, for a minute there, I was like, "Ooh, where did Ross go?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢了   我想说你和麦克见面的第一场戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. And I have to say that first scene where you meet Mae...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样   我的天哪   我是说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Oh, my God. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天就到此为止了   多谢你们的帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that's enough for today. Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.29,0:21:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他拖我们后腿了  就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Holding us back. Totally.
